<section>
<h4>Accessibility Considerations</h4>
<p>Creating accessible web content enables users of all abilities to interact with your website effectively.</p>
<ul>
<li>Use proper heading hierarchy (h1-h6) to establish document structure</li>
<li>Include descriptive alt text for images</li>
<li>Ensure sufficient color contrast for text readability</li>
<li>Use semantic elements to improve screen reader navigation</li>
<li>Provide keyboard navigability for all interactive elements</li>
</ul>
</section>

<section>
<h4>Performance Optimization</h4>
<p>Well-structured HTML contributes to better site performance and user experience.</p>
<ul>
<li>Keep markup clean and minimal</li>
